Source: hostap-daemon
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ben Wang <benw@qti.qualcomm.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               libnl-3-dev,
               libnl-genl-3-dev,
               libssl-dev,
               pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://git.codelinaro.org/

Package: hostapd
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: hostapd for SoftAP - Qualcomm build
 Hostapd (host access point daemon) built from Qualcomm source
 (external/wpa_supplicant_8/hostapd, v2.12-devel) with QCA-specific
 features enabled via defconfig-qcacld.
 .
 Enables a network interface card to act as an access point and
 authentication server. Supports open mode and security modes
 (WPA2/WPA3).
 .
 Enabled QCA features:
  - CONFIG_DRIVER_NL80211_QCA: QCA vendor nl80211 extensions
  - CONFIG_IEEE80211AC / CONFIG_IEEE80211AX: Wi-Fi 5/6 support
  - CONFIG_SAE: WPA3-Personal
  - CONFIG_OWE: Opportunistic Wireless Encryption
